+Before running Node or npm, use the launcher for your shell. It removes inherited
+`OTEL_*`, `GRAFANA_CLOUD_*`, `COMPOSE_FILE`, Node preload/search-path/proxy controls,
+and npm's Node options for the command. Opening a new terminal alone does not clear inherited
+configuration. In particular, a signal-specific endpoint overrides a generic
+OTLP endpoint, and `NODE_OPTIONS` can load instrumentation before a script starts.
+The launchers leave the caller's environment unchanged. They preserve the
+intentional `COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME`, `DEMO_HTTP_PORT`, and `PIPELINE_APP_URL`
+settings used for an isolated local stack.
